      "image": "/Assets/team/hod.jpeg",
      "message": "Welcome to Version'26. As we embark on this journey of innovation and technical excellence, I am proud to see the dedication and creativity of our students.\n\nThis event stands as a testament to the department's commitment to fostering technological advancement and holistic development. I encourage all participants to make the most of this platform to learn, compete, and grow."
